{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这事儿真的不用这么大动干戈  (You Really Didn't Need to Go That Far)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside Xingtian after work, Bu Xiaogu thanks her young admirer for helping save Twelve Singers and is stunned to learn he donated ninety-nine percent of his hard-earned three million yuan to charity to fund ten rural schools. Listen to Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没想到辛惠美的影响这么巨大，会有这么好的效果。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我给你跪了，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一共三百万？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天其实我就是随便说说，你不用把我的话放在心上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你真的不用这么大动干戈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的，我觉得太破费了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "确实很有意义。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对啊，下班回家。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，我坐你的车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新闻刚发了一条消息！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新闻说惠美跟一个小孩被拍了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没想到辛惠美的影响这么巨大，会有这么好的效果。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never imagined Xin Huimei's influence would be so immense and bring such amazing results.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我给你跪了，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I bow down to you in gratitude — thank you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一共三百万？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Three million yuan in total?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天其实我就是随便说说，你不用把我的话放在心上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That night I was just chatting casually; you really didn't need to take my words so much to heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你真的不用这么大动干戈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You truly didn't need to go to such extraordinary lengths.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的，我觉得太破费了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really, I feel you spent far too much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "确实很有意义。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Building ten charity schools really is deeply meaningful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对啊，下班回家。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, heading home after work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，我坐你的车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure, I'll take a ride with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a second!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新闻刚发了一条消息！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A breaking news alert just came out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新闻说惠美跟一个小孩被拍了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The news says Huimei was just photographed with a child!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
